1. The sentence is probably misleading. lavTestLRT apparently sorts the models based on the df. See source code (lines 76-80): https://github.com/cran/lavaan/blob/master/R/lav_test_LRT.R
2. I don't see any difference here. Maybe it has implications for your search for partial invariance. It depends on how you approach this.

HTH

